{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2019-02", "window": 4, "start_date": 1550793600, "end_date": 1551398399, "month_true_total": 34, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:15:51 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "49272651", "author": {"steamid": "76561198126165717", "personaname": "jmstusak", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198126165717/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 3469, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1256, "last_played": 1642991140, "avatar": "a41bba94e272038c2f62d704f0b8e689592e52e3"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is amazing! so simple in execution but still complex in gameplay.", "timestamp_created": 1551328217, "timestamp_updated": 1551328217, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.538919746875762939", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49257362", "author": {"steamid": "76561198170206542", "personaname": "Quetzan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Quetzan/", "num_games_owned": 220, "num_reviews": 55, "playtime_forever": 1704, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1187, "last_played": 1646723541, "avatar": "b1a4c624f71ec16205a0980a4338632c5087fb1a"}, "language": "english", "review": "1 Laser Turbine: \"wow, this is a pretty cool item\"\n\n15 Laser Turbines: HOLD Z SIMULATOR", "timestamp_created": 1551244916, "timestamp_updated": 1551244916, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49250664", "author": {"steamid": "76561197992040071", "personaname": "zantanzuken", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/zantanzuken/", "num_games_owned": 617, "num_reviews": 77, "playtime_forever": 9049, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8480, "last_played": 1551670003, "avatar": "076c27be2bef2222da93b2d524dd74a8eb6af8c8"}, "language": "english", "review": "Starts off super hard and death is permanent (rogue-lite), but once you get the hang of the controls and how to manage your time over your money... mmph... and then you unlock more cool and interesting items to get, and each one has its own special thing that it does... and they stack and stack and stack and suddenly the game you thought was hard is now the easiest thing in the world and your computer is screaming in pain because of all the explosions happening all at once.\n\nand then it ends.\n\n.... and then you do it again.", "timestamp_created": 1551207176, "timestamp_updated": 1551207176, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49211241", "author": {"steamid": "76561198083011155", "personaname": "mezu pezu", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Erinhforth/", "num_games_owned": 291, "num_reviews": 74, "playtime_forever": 3784, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3774, "last_played": 1771251216, "avatar": "f3b1c5177a58fda490f3bb3642bb4fbe0873c1ad"}, "language": "english", "review": "My favorite game in my library! Honestly, it's a fantastic game!\n\nYou can play with up to 4 players using controllers (or a mix of controllers and keyboard, like 2 players on controllers and 2 sharing the same keyboard, similar to web games). It's perfect for playing when you have friends over. While it can be tricky to remember what each item does at first, you'll eventually get the hang of it after a few hours of gameplay.\n\n*Don't forget, RoR 2 is available on Steam right now!", "timestamp_created": 1551016706, "timestamp_updated": 1725988385, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.552715659141540527", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49206343", "author": {"steamid": "76561198016204324", "personaname": "Rowdy 4skin", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198016204324/", "num_games_owned": 417, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 3522, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2764, "last_played": 1550291196, "avatar": "3d333bac75c9eb2047c897aee8d786e4d456a3c1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Criminally underrated indie roguelite. Very fun for both solo and local multiplayer sessions. Unfortunately I had difficulty getting anywhere trying to play with friends online, as you have to set up a server and neither of us felt motivated enough to dedicate the time and energy to port forward and fuss with actually making it work. That said though extremely good game.\n\n9/10", "timestamp_created": 1550999818, "timestamp_updated": 1550999818, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}